  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5301.20 \"Out-of-service\" means a motorcycle that is not in a condition to be safely operated by a student during a motorcycle rider education program.\n\nSource. #8403, eff 8-2-05; ss by #10589, eff 5-14-14; ss by #14174, eff 1-17-25 (formerly Saf-C 5301.19)",
